 down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV3) is open for checkout-api. It records the change, the approval, the health after the deploy, and v2.3.0 as the last healthy version to roll back to if needed. Opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}